{"title": "Sharpshooter: Low Ground", "pageid": 21516, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sharpshooter:_Low_Ground", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp/300px-Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp, /w/images/6/65/Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp/300px-Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Sharpshooter_Low_Ground.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sharpshooter: Low Ground</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sharpshooter\">Sharpshooter</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. Characters with this feature don't receive any penalty when attacking from below their target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your ranged weapon attacks are not penalized for <a href=\"/wiki/High_Ground_Rules\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Ground Rules\">High Ground Rules</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sharpshooter\">Sharpshooter</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Devotee_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Devotee of Mahkloompah\">Devotee of Mahkloompah</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195358\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 460/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1911/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1173/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 169/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 641293/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.615      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.615      1 -total\n 22.33%    5.942      1 Template:PageSeo\n 20.76%    5.525      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.71%    3.916      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.46%    3.315      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  8.19%    2.181      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  5.73%    1.524      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  5.64%    1.502      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  1.65%    0.439      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21516-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195358 and revision id 375894. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}